## Installation

**1. Clone the repository**

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Shahan-Waheed728/Python_Practical_Journey.git
```

**2. Navigate to the project directory**

```bash
cd Python_Practical_Journey/python_practical_journey/selenium_journey/Book_Scraper
```

**3. Create and activate a virtual environment (optional if already using one)**

On Windows:

```powershell
python -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1
```

**4. Install dependencies**

```bash
python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
```

**5. Run the scraper**

```bash
python scraping.py
```

Google Chrome must be installed. Selenium Manager normally handles compatible ChromeDriver setup automatically.

